Z||000001||isthiswhereiputausername?||10-03-2001||10:19 AM||||If you live in a wet area- mud inside rim? (happened to me before) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>otherwise maybe a bump on a tire..visually look over the 4 wheels, and  since the car was alligned the front end *Should* have been inspected  and checked for tightness by them..<P>when did you last have the tires balanced? sometimes rim weights do fall off..<P>||||reg||1
